WEBVTT

00:40:28.287 --> 00:40:30.293
Hearts change, you know?

00:40:30.317 --> 00:40:34.839
Events occur that shock us
even as they're happening to us,

00:40:34.863 --> 00:40:38.314
and it never occurred to me
not to be very open and honest about it.

00:40:38.338 --> 00:40:39.777
I put it right out there.

00:40:39.801 --> 00:40:43.011
I wanted to be able to walk around
holding Rayya's hand

00:40:43.035 --> 00:40:46.579
without having to feel like
I was doing something wrong.

00:40:46.603 --> 00:40:49.804
And I just felt like,
well, I'm a known person,

00:40:49.828 --> 00:40:51.981
you're going to be seeing me
with this person.

00:40:52.005 --> 00:40:54.698
Let me tell you what's going on.
Here's what's going on.

00:40:54.722 --> 00:40:59.118
And the response of the world
has been completely loving

00:40:59.142 --> 00:41:00.794
and very beautiful.